1
00:00:00,426 --> 00:00:05,517
A reader abroad opens the map of Portugal: all 308 municipalities, from INE's official prices.

2
00:00:05,517 --> 00:00:11,064
They type their budget in their own currency: 11,200,000 USD.

3
00:00:11,064 --> 00:00:17,064
They look for Loulé. The camera flies there.

4
00:00:17,843 --> 00:00:26,843
The place card: square metres for the budget, ten years of prices and rents, yield and momentum. All INE, with the period.

5
00:00:27,958 --> 00:00:35,057
Then the partner layer: your project as a pin, labelled “Sponsored”, with its own card.

6
00:00:35,057 --> 00:00:44,057
Next, the path a buyer from their country follows, step by step, and where questions become enquiries.

7
00:00:44,201 --> 00:00:53,201
On your own site, the same map in your colour, “Powered by Imóveis Portugal”.

8
00:00:53,214 --> 00:01:02,214
And each month, a report: placements seen, clicks and enquiries by country and budget. Illustrative example, not real data.

9
00:01:02,726 --> 00:01:07,726
Private demo prepared for you · not published.
